        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 4.5MW, onshore, foundation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 4.5MW, onshore, foundation
UUID=630e4a00-e193-3c91-ba1d-453f71ec0d1d
Wind turbine foundation, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Vestas V163-4.5MW onshore wind turbine (Martinez Aguado &amp; Garrett, 2025). 
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
